WEBVTT

00:09.143 --> 00:10.311
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.344 --> 00:12.246
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.280 --> 00:13.447
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.481 --> 00:15.449
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.483 --> 00:18.452
* OOH!
*哦！

00:18.486 --> 00:20.621
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.654 --> 00:22.623
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.656 --> 00:24.458
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:24.492 --> 00:26.327
* SPONGEBOB
SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝
方裤！ *

00:26.360 --> 00:28.696
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH *
*如果航海废话
成为您所希望的*

00:28.729 --> 00:30.198
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.231 --> 00:32.466
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑腾*

00:32.500 --> 00:34.602
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
READY?
* 海绵宝宝！ *
准备好？

00:34.635 --> 00:36.604
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:36.637 --> 00:38.806
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:38.839 --> 00:40.541
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.574 --> 00:44.345
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:44.378 --> 00:46.480
( hearty laughter )
（爽朗的笑声）

00:46.514 --> 00:48.649
( flute playing )
（长笛演奏）

00:51.552 --> 00:55.189
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
