美国教育部

00:55.223 --> 00:58.526
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:02.896 --> 01:08.802
Spongebob:
GOOD MORNING, BIKINI BOTTOM.
海绵宝宝：
早上好，比基尼泳裤。

01:08.836 --> 01:12.706
AH, WHAT A BEAUTIFUL DAY.
啊，多么美好的一天啊。

01:12.740 --> 01:14.575
* DOO-DOO-DOO-DOO, DOO-DOO-DOO
* 嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟

01:14.608 --> 01:16.377
I WONDER IF PATRICK'S AT HOME.
我想知道帕特里克是否在家。

01:16.410 --> 01:17.645
HIYA, SPONGEBOB.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

01:17.678 --> 01:19.213
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
你在干什么？

01:19.247 --> 01:21.215
GOING OVER TO
SANDY'S PLACE.
转到
桑迪的地方。

01:21.249 --> 01:22.483
HEY, WHAT'S THIS?
嘿，这是什么？

01:22.516 --> 01:24.485
THIS DOESN'T LOOK
LIKE SANDY'S PLACE.
这看起来不像
就像桑迪的地方。

01:24.518 --> 01:27.255
DON'T LOSE YOUR
BARNACLES, BOYS.
不要失去你的
藤壶，孩子们。

01:27.288 --> 01:28.289
( kaiais )
（凯艾斯）

01:28.322 --> 01:29.423
THERE IT IS.
就在那里。

01:29.457 --> 01:30.524
WHAT IS IT?
它是什么？

01:30.558 --> 01:31.659
CAN'T YOU SEE?
你看不到吗？

01:31.692 --> 01:32.660
IT'S TEXAS.
这是德克萨斯州。

01:32.693 --> 01:34.162
Spongebob:
"TEXAS"?
海绵宝宝：
“德克萨斯”？

01:34.195 --> 01:37.598
WHAT'S A TEXAS?
什么是德克萨斯州？

01:37.631 --> 01:40.868
OH, IT'S NOTHING
BUT A MEMORY NOW.
哦，没什么
但现在已经成为回忆了。

01:40.901 --> 01:42.170
ALL RIGHT, THEN.
好吧，那么。

01:42.203 --> 01:43.837
UH, LET'S MAKE ONE
OF YOUR TREE DOME.
呃，我们来做一个吧
您的树穹。

01:43.871 --> 01:45.273
Y-YOU KNOW,
ALL OF A SUDDEN
你-你知道，
一切突然发生

01:45.306 --> 01:47.508
I DON'T FEEL MUCH LIKE
SANDCASTLES, SPONGEBOB.
我不太喜欢
沙堡，海绵宝宝。

01:47.541 --> 01:48.576
I'LL SEE Y'ALL LATER.
稍后再见。

01:48.609 --> 01:50.244
HMM?
唔？

01:50.278 --> 01:51.412
SANDY...
沙...

01:51.445 --> 01:54.348
( kaiaiing )
（凯爱）

01:54.382 --> 01:56.250
AW, SPONGEBOB
噢，海绵宝宝

01:56.284 --> 01:58.719
I'M JUST NOT FEELING
UP TO KARATE RIGHT NOW.
我只是没有感觉
现在开始空手道。

01:58.752 --> 01:59.753
( laughing )
（笑）

01:59.787 --> 02:00.788
I GET IT.
我得到它。

02:00.821 --> 02:03.824
"NOT FEELING UP TO KARATE," HUH?
“不喜欢空手道，”是吗？

02:03.857 --> 02:06.194
WHATEVER YOU SAY, SANDY.
不管你说什么，桑迪。

02:06.227 --> 02:08.896
BOY, I HOPE
SANDY DOESN'T ATTACK ME
男孩，我希望
桑迪没有攻击我

02:08.929 --> 02:10.431
FROM BEHIND.
从后面。

02:10.464 --> 02:11.432
( kaiaiing )
（凯爱）

02:11.465 --> 02:13.601
( growing )
（成长中）

02:13.634 --> 02:15.569
( grunting and groaning )
（咕哝和呻吟）

02:17.605 --> 02:19.540
UH... SANDY?
呃……桑迪？

02:19.573 --> 02:21.775
SURF'S UP, SANDY.
冲浪吧，桑迪。

02:21.809 --> 02:23.777
NO THANKS.
不，谢谢。

02:23.811 --> 02:26.380
( jellyfish buzzing )
（水母嗡嗡声）

02:26.414 --> 02:29.950
BOY, THERE'S NOTHING
LIKE GOING JELLYFISHING.
男孩，什么都没有
就像去捉水母一样。

02:29.983 --> 02:31.652
( giddy laughter )
（头晕的笑声）

02:31.685 --> 02:33.321
WHOA!
哇啊！

02:33.354 --> 02:35.556
( giddy laughter )
（头晕的笑声）

02:35.589 --> 02:37.558
LOOK, SANDY,
WE CAUGHT ONE!
看，桑迪，
我们抓到了一只！

02:37.591 --> 02:39.427
LISTEN, SPONGEBOB
听着，海绵宝宝

02:39.460 --> 02:41.595
RIGHT NOW, I DON'T WANT
TO BUILD SANDCASTLES
现在，我不想
建造沙堡

02:41.629 --> 02:43.431
PLAY KARATE OR EAT JELLYFISH.
玩空手道或吃水母。

02:43.464 --> 02:44.665
( laughing )
（笑）

02:44.698 --> 02:46.200
WE DON'T EAT 'EM!
我们不吃它们！

02:46.234 --> 02:47.335
WE LET 'EM GO!
我们让他们走！

02:47.368 --> 02:49.337
FLY AWAY,
LITTLE CRITTER!
飞走，
小动物！

02:49.370 --> 02:51.972
GO ON, GO BACK HOME
WHERE YOU BELONG.
继续，回家
你属于哪里。

02:52.005 --> 02:54.408
RUN ALONG, BACK TO YOUR FAMILY
AND FRIENDS.
一路奔跑，回到家人身边
和朋友们。

02:54.442 --> 02:55.476
I KNOW THEY MISS YOU
我知道他们想念你

02:55.509 --> 02:56.777
AS MUCH AS YOU MISS THEM.
尽管您很想念他们。

02:56.810 --> 02:59.313
HURRY, BEFORE THEY FORGET YOU
AND LEAVE YOU BEHIND!
快点，在他们忘记你之前
让你落后！

02:59.347 --> 03:00.414
REMEMBER--
记住 -

03:00.448 --> 03:02.650
* THERE'S NO PLACE
LIKE HOME *
* 没有地方了
喜欢家 *

03:02.683 --> 03:05.419
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

03:05.453 --> 03:07.721
( gurgling sobs )
（咯咯的抽泣声）

03:11.892 --> 03:13.494
( flushing )
（冲水）

03:13.527 --> 03:15.463
( gasping )
（喘气）

03:15.496 --> 03:17.798
SANDY, WHAT THE HECK
ARE YOU CRYING ABOUT?
桑迪，到底是什么？
你在哭吗？

03:17.831 --> 03:21.235
I AIN'T CRYIN',
MY HELMET JUST SPRUNG A LEAK.
我没有哭，
我的头盔刚刚漏水。

03:21.269 --> 03:22.870
SANDY...
沙...

03:22.903 --> 03:26.240
OH, I GUESS I'M JUST FEELING
A LITTLE HOMESICK.
哦，我想我只是感觉
有点想家。

03:26.274 --> 03:28.642
HOMESICK, HUH?
想家了，嗯？

03:28.676 --> 03:30.644
MM-MMM.
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。
MM-MMM。

03:30.678 --> 03:32.313
Spongebob:
ALMOST THERE!
海绵宝宝：
快到了！

03:32.346 --> 03:34.715
DAD-GUM IT, SPONGEBOB,
WHAT IS IT?
爸爸给海绵宝宝口香糖，
它是什么？

03:34.748 --> 03:36.284
* DA, TA-DA!
* 达，达-达！

03:36.317 --> 03:40.254
Spongebob and Patrick:
WELCOME HOME, SANDY!
海绵宝宝和帕特里克：
欢迎回家，桑迪！

03:40.288 --> 03:41.889
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

03:45.293 --> 03:45.993
SANDY?
沙？

03:46.026 --> 03:47.595
GO AWAY.
离开。

03:49.930 --> 03:51.732
I DON'T GET IT, PATRICK.
我不明白，帕特里克。

03:51.765 --> 03:53.567
WHAT'S WRONG WITH SANDY?
桑迪怎么了？

03:53.601 --> 03:56.404
MAYBE IT'S JUST
A SQUIRREL THING.
也许这只是
松鼠的事。

03:59.573 --> 04:02.710
( tuning )
（调音）

04:02.743 --> 04:07.681
* WISH I WAS BACK IN TEXAS
* 希望我回到德克萨斯州

04:07.715 --> 04:12.386
* THE OCEAN'S NO PLACE
FOR A SQUIRREL *
* 海洋无处可去
对于松鼠 *

04:14.655 --> 04:17.057
* WISH I WAS IN TEXAS
*希望我在德克萨斯州

04:17.090 --> 04:20.428
* PRETTIEST PLACE
IN THE WORLD *
* 最漂亮的地方
在世界上*

04:20.461 --> 04:22.530
* OH, NO
* 哦，不

04:22.563 --> 04:24.598
* I GUESS A-DEEP IN MY HEART
*我猜A-在我内心深处

04:24.632 --> 04:28.302
* I'LL ALWAYS BE
A TEXAS GIRL *
* 我将永远是
德克萨斯女孩 *

04:29.670 --> 04:34.442
* I WANT TO GO HO-O-O-O-OME
* 我想去 HO-O-O-O-OME

04:34.475 --> 04:36.577
* HO-OME
* 霍-奥梅

04:36.610 --> 04:38.779
( clams howling )
（蛤蜊嚎叫）

04:40.981 --> 04:43.317
( Sandy yodeling )
（桑迪约德尔歌）

04:43.351 --> 04:45.453
HEY, PATRICK--
LISTEN TO THAT!
嘿，帕特里克——
听听！

04:45.486 --> 04:47.521
GET 'EM OFF ME!
GET 'EM OFF ME!
把他们从我身上拿开！
把他们从我身上拿开！

04:47.555 --> 04:48.689
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

04:48.722 --> 04:50.391
LISTEN...
HEAR THAT?
听...
听到了吗？

04:50.424 --> 04:52.393
IT'S SANDY.
这是桑迪。

04:52.426 --> 04:56.764
* I WANT TO WAKE UP IN TEXAS
* 我想在德克萨斯州醒来

04:56.797 --> 05:00.668
* I MISS THOSE WIDE-OPEN SKIES
*我想念那些广阔的天空

05:00.701 --> 05:01.902
( chittering )
（叽叽喳喳）

05:03.571 --> 05:05.406
* I MISS MY 20 ACRES
* 我想念我的 20 英亩土地

05:05.439 --> 05:09.477
* BARBECUES AND PECAN PIES
* 烧烤和山核桃派

05:09.510 --> 05:11.011
* OH, WHY
*哦，为什么

05:11.044 --> 05:13.581
* WHEN I'M SO FAR FROM YOU,
TEXAS *
*当我离你如此遥远时，
德克萨斯州 *

05:13.614 --> 05:17.851
* ALL I CAN DO IS CRY
*我能做的就是哭泣

05:19.086 --> 05:20.988
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

05:21.021 --> 05:22.656
( music continues )
（音乐继续）

05:22.690 --> 05:24.958
( sniffing )
（嗅）

05:24.992 --> 05:26.660
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

05:26.694 --> 05:28.662
( Sandy yodels )
（桑迪约德尔歌）

05:28.696 --> 05:30.698
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

05:34.502 --> 05:36.103
( blowing )
（吹）

05:38.406 --> 05:41.875
* I WANT TO GO HO-O-O-OME
* 我想去 HO-O-O-OME

05:41.909 --> 05:45.613
( deep voice ):
* I WANT TO GO HO-OME.
（低沉的声音）：
* 我想回家。

05:46.880 --> 05:48.882
( sobbing loudly )
（大声抽泣）

05:51.485 --> 05:53.521
DO YOU THINK SHE KNOWS
THE MUFFIN MAN SONG?
你认为她知道吗
松饼人之歌？

05:53.554 --> 05:56.790
PATRICK, SHE SANG THAT
SONG FROM HER HEART!
帕特里克，她唱过这首歌
发自内心的歌！

05:56.824 --> 05:58.992
SHE REALLY MISSES TEXAS.
她真的很想念德克萨斯州。

05:59.026 --> 06:02.430
WELL, LET'S GO GET SOME TEXAS
AND BRING IT DOWN HERE.
好吧，我们去德克萨斯州吧
把它带到这里。

06:02.463 --> 06:04.432
PATRICK,
YOU CAN'T...
帕特里克，
你不能...

06:04.465 --> 06:05.899
THAT'S IT!
就是这样！

06:05.933 --> 06:07.901
PATRICK, YOUR
GENIUS IS SHOWING.
帕特里克，你的
天才正在显现。

06:07.935 --> 06:09.870
WHERE?!
在哪里？！

06:09.903 --> 06:12.139
EVERYTHING
LOOKS PERFECT.
一切
看起来很完美。

06:12.172 --> 06:13.907
WE'RE GOING TO GO
GET SANDY NOW.
我们要走了
现在就去桑迪吧。

06:13.941 --> 06:15.676
Mr. Krabs:
WELL, HURRY IT UP, LADS!
蟹老板先生：
好吧，快点，小伙子们！

06:15.709 --> 06:17.010
CAN'T SQUAT LIKE THIS FOREVER!
不能永远这样深蹲！

06:17.044 --> 06:19.913
Spongebob and Patrick:
KRUSTY KRAB! KRUSTY KRAB!
海绵宝宝和帕特里克：
脆皮蟹！脆皮蟹！

06:19.947 --> 06:22.516
SANDY'S SURPRISE
IS AT THE KRUSTY KRAB!
桑迪的惊喜
就在 Krusty Krab 餐厅！

06:22.550 --> 06:24.117
WAIT'LL SHE SEES THE...
等等她会看到...

06:24.151 --> 06:25.185
SHH!
嘘！

06:25.218 --> 06:26.720
DON'T SPOIL
THE SURPRISE.
不要破坏
惊喜。

06:26.754 --> 06:27.755
( giggling )
（咯咯笑）

06:29.523 --> 06:30.724
HEY, SANDY!
HEY, SANDY!
嘿，桑迪！
嘿，桑迪！

06:30.758 --> 06:32.059
YOU WANT TO
COME WITH US
你想要
和我们一起来

06:32.092 --> 06:33.694
TO THE KRUSTY KRAB?
去脆皮蟹吗？

06:33.727 --> 06:35.429
HEY, SPONGEBOB.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

06:35.463 --> 06:36.964
HEY, PATRICK.
嘿，帕特里克。

06:36.997 --> 06:38.866
WHAT ARE YOU DOING
WITH THOSE BAGS?
你在做什么
带着那些袋子？

06:38.899 --> 06:41.001
I'M GOIN' BACK HOME TO TEXAS.
我要回德克萨斯州的家了。

06:41.034 --> 06:42.135
WHAT?! NOW?!
什么？！现在？！

06:42.169 --> 06:44.472
YOU CAN'T! I MEAN, WE...
你不能！我的意思是，我们...

06:44.505 --> 06:47.007
IT'S TIME FOR
THIS TUMBLEWEED
TO TUMBLE ON HOME.
是时候了
这种风滚草
跌倒在家里。

06:47.040 --> 06:48.476
W-WAIT, SANDY.
等等，桑迪。

06:48.509 --> 06:50.711
YOU CAN'T, UH...
'CAUSE WE WERE GONNA...
你不能，呃...
因为我们要...

06:50.744 --> 06:53.046
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB
IS... THAT IS NOT
THE RIGHT DIRECTION...
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅
是……那不是
正确的方向...

06:53.080 --> 06:55.048
WAIT! IF YOU DON'T...
IF I CAN'T...
等待！如果你不...
如果我不能...

06:55.082 --> 06:56.550
( sputtering )
（溅射）

06:56.584 --> 06:58.051
SANDY, WAIT A SECOND!
桑迪，等一下！

06:58.085 --> 06:59.720
YOU DON'T WANT TO
LEAVE WITHOUT HAVING
你不想
不带就离开

06:59.753 --> 07:01.722
ONE LAST CODDY-BATTY
DOWN AT THE KRUSTY KRAB!
最后一张科迪-巴蒂
去蟹堡吧！

07:01.755 --> 07:03.691
I'M TIRED OF FISH
FOOD, SPONGEBOB.
我厌倦了鱼
食物，海绵宝宝。

07:03.724 --> 07:06.126
B-BUT SANDY,
DON'T YOU WANT
TO SAY GOOD-BYE
但、但是桑迪，
你不想要吗
说再见

07:06.159 --> 07:08.629
TO ALL YOUR FRIENDS
DOWN AT THE KRUSTY KRAB?
致您所有的朋友
去吃脆皮蟹吗？

07:08.662 --> 07:10.464
I JUST CAN'T DO
THAT, SPONGEBOB.
我就是做不到
那，海绵宝宝。

07:10.498 --> 07:12.500
IT'D BE TOO SAD.
这太悲伤了。

07:14.535 --> 07:16.504
N-NO, NO, WAIT!
不，不，不，等等！

07:16.537 --> 07:17.771
SANDY!
沙！

07:20.140 --> 07:22.810
I CAN'T BELIEVE
SHE'S GONE.
我不敢相信
她走了。

07:22.843 --> 07:26.647
YEAH. WHAT'S SO GREAT
ABOUT DUMB, OLD TEXAS?
是的。有什么很棒的
关于“愚蠢的老德克萨斯”？

07:28.048 --> 07:30.250
WHAT DID YOU SAY?
你说什么？

07:30.283 --> 07:32.119
TEXAS IS DUMB?
德克萨斯州很愚蠢吗？

07:32.152 --> 07:36.524
DON'T YOU DARE
TAKE THE NAME OF TEXAS IN VAIN!
你不敢吗
徒劳地使用德克萨斯州的名字！

07:36.557 --> 07:39.527
YOU MEAN WE CAN'T
SAY ANYTHING BAD
ABOUT DUMB, OLD TEXAS?
你的意思是我们不能
说任何坏话
关于“愚蠢的老德克萨斯”？

07:39.560 --> 07:40.861
NO, YOU CAN'T!
不，你不能！

07:40.894 --> 07:45.098
OH, THEN, CAN WE
SAY PEOPLE FROM
TEXAS ARE DUMB?
哦，那么我们可以吗
说人们来自
德克萨斯州很愚蠢吗？

07:45.132 --> 07:48.869
NO! YOU CAN'T SAY NOTHIN'
ABOUT TEXAS!
不！你不能说什么
关于德克萨斯州！

07:50.671 --> 07:51.972
OH!
哦！

07:52.005 --> 07:56.777
SO WE SHOULDN'T SAY ANYTHING BAD
ABOUT TEX-AS!
所以我们不应该说任何坏话
关于 TEX-AS！

07:56.810 --> 07:59.813
I'M WARNING YOU, SPONGEBOB!
我警告你，海绵宝宝！

07:59.847 --> 08:01.915
LOOK, PATRICK--
I'M TEXAS!
看，帕特里克——
我是德克萨斯州！

08:01.949 --> 08:03.884
DUH, HOWDY, Y'ALL!
呃，你们好！

08:03.917 --> 08:05.753
I'M TEXAS, TOO.
我也是德克萨斯州。

08:05.786 --> 08:07.655
GET A DOG, LITTLE LONGIE.
养只狗吧，小朗吉。

08:07.688 --> 08:09.289
HOWDY, Y'ALL!
大家好！

08:09.322 --> 08:11.091
HOWDY, Y'ALL!
大家好！

08:11.124 --> 08:12.893
GET A DOG,
LITTLE LONGIE!
养一只狗，
小朗吉！

08:12.926 --> 08:14.161
GET A DOG...
养只狗...

08:14.194 --> 08:16.029
Y'ALL BEST CUT IT OUT!
你们最好把它剪掉！

08:16.063 --> 08:19.066
* THE STARS AT NIGHT
ARE DULL AND DIM *
* 夜晚的星星
暗淡无光 *

08:19.099 --> 08:21.569
* WHENEVER
THEY HAVE TO BE *
* 无论何时
他们必须是 *

08:21.602 --> 08:23.937
* OVER DUMB, OLD,
STUPID TEXAS! *
* 太笨了，太老了，
愚蠢的德克萨斯！ *

08:23.971 --> 08:25.806
HEY, PATRICK, WHAT AM I NOW?
嘿，帕特里克，我现在是什么？

08:25.839 --> 08:27.575
UH... STUPID?
呃...愚蠢？

08:27.608 --> 08:29.777
NO, I'M TEXAS!
不，我是德克萨斯州！

08:29.810 --> 08:31.645
WHAT'S THE DIFFERENCE!
有什么区别！

08:31.679 --> 08:33.246
( guffawing )
（大笑）

08:34.815 --> 08:36.584
YOU ALL BEST APOLOGIZE
你们最好道歉

08:36.617 --> 08:38.852
OR I'M GOING TO BE ON YOU
LIKE UGLY ON AN APE!
或者我会在你身边
就像猿猴身上的丑陋一样！

08:38.886 --> 08:40.621
YOU'LL HAVE
TO CATCH US FIRST!
你将会有
首先抓住我们！

08:40.654 --> 08:41.822
( taunting laughter )
（嘲讽的笑声）

08:41.855 --> 08:43.256
( both panting )
（两人都气喘吁吁）

08:43.290 --> 08:45.593
WE DID IT.
WE GOT HER.
我们做到了。
我们找到她了。

08:45.626 --> 08:47.995
KRUSTY KRAB,
HERE WE COME!
脆皮蟹，
我们来了！

08:49.897 --> 08:53.734
CAN WE SAY THAT PLANTS
FROM TEXAS ARE DUMB?
我们可以说植物吗
来自德克萨斯州的人很笨吗？

08:53.767 --> 08:55.335
( guffaws )
（大笑）

08:55.368 --> 08:59.707
CAN WE SAY THAT SHOES
FROM TEXAS ARE DUMB?
我们可以说鞋子吗
来自德克萨斯州的人很笨吗？

08:59.740 --> 09:01.942
UH, OKAY, PATRICK,
THAT'S ENOUGH.
呃，好吧，帕特里克，
够了。

09:01.975 --> 09:06.914
WHY? DO YOU THINK
THAT OLD SLOWPOKE,
TEXAS, IS GONNA...
为什么？你认为
那个老呆呆，
德克萨斯州，将会...

09:10.250 --> 09:12.252
( screaming )
（尖叫）

09:12.285 --> 09:14.922
RUN FASTER,
PATRICK!
跑得更快，
帕特里克！

09:14.955 --> 09:16.757
( both screaming )
（两人都尖叫）

09:28.802 --> 09:29.770
( screams )
（尖叫声）

09:29.803 --> 09:31.772
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

09:31.805 --> 09:33.974
( screaming )
（尖叫）

09:35.075 --> 09:37.177
( gasping )
（喘气）

09:37.210 --> 09:39.179
( teeth chattering )
（牙齿打颤）

09:39.212 --> 09:41.048
( Sandy kiaiing )
（桑迪·基艾因）

09:42.282 --> 09:44.251
( gasping )
（喘气）

09:44.284 --> 09:46.687
YOU'RE GOING
TO TAKE BACK WHAT YOU SAID!
你要去
收回你所说的话！

09:46.720 --> 09:48.321
( sputtering and gasping )
（溅射和喘气）

09:48.355 --> 09:49.723
NO!
不！

09:49.757 --> 09:51.792
ALMOST THERE.
快到了。

09:53.060 --> 09:54.094
( grunting )
（咕哝）

09:57.197 --> 09:58.198
( screaming )
（尖叫）

10:07.374 --> 10:09.743
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

10:09.777 --> 10:11.344
YOU BEEN MESSIN' WITH THE BULL!
你一直在惹公牛！

10:11.378 --> 10:14.682
NOW HERE COME THE HORNS!
现在喇叭来了！

10:15.415 --> 10:16.349
NO, SANDY!
不，桑迪！

10:17.350 --> 10:19.252
NO!
不！

10:19.286 --> 10:21.789
All:
HOWDY, YA'LL!
全部：
你好，你们！

10:21.822 --> 10:24.658
WHA... WHAT'S THIS?
这……这是什么？

10:24.692 --> 10:26.326
IT'S A PARTY.
这是一场派对。

10:26.359 --> 10:27.961
FOR YOU!
为你！

10:27.995 --> 10:29.663
FOR ME?!
为我？！

10:29.697 --> 10:31.699
IT'S YOUR OWN LITTLE
SLICE OF TEXAS.
这是你自己的小
德克萨斯州的一部分。

10:31.732 --> 10:32.866
CHECK IT OUT, SANDY.
检查一下，桑迪。

10:32.900 --> 10:34.702
WE GOT SQUARE DANCIN'...
我们有广场舞...

10:34.735 --> 10:36.069
GIANT BARBY-Q's...
巨型芭比Q的...

10:36.103 --> 10:37.738
OW, OW, OW, OW, OW.
欧，欧，欧，欧，欧。

10:37.771 --> 10:40.407
HOMEMADE PEAS-
IN-A-CAN PIES
自制豌豆-
罐头馅饼

10:40.440 --> 10:43.977
AND WE GOT OUR VERY OWN
TEN-GALLON HATS.
我们有自己的
十加仑的帽子。

10:45.278 --> 10:47.147
SO, WHAT DO YOU THINK?
YOU GONNA STAY?
那么，你觉得怎么样？
你要留下来吗？

10:49.282 --> 10:51.084
( laughing )
（笑）

10:54.988 --> 10:56.990
( gurgling laughter )
（咯咯笑声）

10:59.226 --> 11:01.228
DON'T CRY ANYMORE,
SANDY.
别再哭了，
桑迪。

11:01.261 --> 11:03.130
I'LL GO GET
YOUR BAGS.
我去拿
你的包。

11:03.163 --> 11:05.232
( gurgling continues )
（咯咯声继续）

11:08.301 --> 11:10.738
( flushing )
（冲水）

11:10.771 --> 11:14.041
I'M NOT CRYIN'.
I'M LAUGHIN'.
我没有哭。
我在笑。

11:14.074 --> 11:16.844
I APPRECIATE WHAT
Y'ALL ARE TRYING
TO DO, SPONGEBOB
我很欣赏什么
你们都在努力
要做的事，海绵宝宝

11:16.877 --> 11:19.713
BUT HOME ISN'T ABOUT
BARBECUES AND PECAN PIES.
但家并不重要
烧烤和山核桃派。

11:19.747 --> 11:21.348
HOME IS WHERE
YOU'RE SURROUNDED
家就在哪里
你被包围了

11:21.381 --> 11:23.450
BY OTHER CRITTERS
THAT CARE ABOUT YOU.
其他生物
关心您。

11:26.019 --> 11:27.354
HUH?
嗯？

11:27.387 --> 11:29.122
DUH, WHAT AM I DOIN'?
呃，我在做什么？

11:29.156 --> 11:30.891
I BEEN HOME ALL ALONG
我一直在家

11:30.924 --> 11:33.761
AND I TOOK ME TILL
JUST NOW TO REALIZE IT.
我带我直到
现在就实现它。

11:33.794 --> 11:35.128
DOES THAT MEAN
YOU'LL STAY?
这是否意味着
你会留下来吗？

11:35.162 --> 11:37.064
I'M STAYIN'!
我留下来！

11:37.097 --> 11:39.432
( all cheering )
（大家欢呼）

11:39.466 --> 11:41.301
WHOO-HOO!
SHE'S STAYIN'!
呼呼！
她留下来！

11:41.334 --> 11:43.203
WHOO! THAT MAKES ME FEEL
ALL WIGGLY!
哇！这让我觉得
都摇摆不定！

11:44.237 --> 11:48.008
YEAH, WHO NEEDS
DUMB, OLD TEXAS?
是的，谁需要
愚蠢的老德克萨斯？

11:48.041 --> 11:49.943
Sandy:
WHAT DID YOU JUST SAY?
桑迪：
你刚才说什么？

11:49.977 --> 11:52.245
Patrick:
SHOULD I START RUNNING NOW?
帕特里克：
我现在应该开始跑步吗？

12:13.133 --> 12:16.904
( evil laughter )
（邪恶的笑声）

12:16.937 --> 12:19.940
ATTENTION, BEACHGOERS!
海滩游客请注意！

12:19.973 --> 12:22.242
YOU ARE TRESPASSING!
你正在非法侵入！

12:22.275 --> 12:24.311
YOU HAVE EXACTLY 17 MINUTES
您只有 17 分钟

12:24.344 --> 12:28.115
TO HAUL YOUR CARCASSES
OFF OF THE FUTURE SITE...
拖拽你的尸体
离开未来的站点...

12:28.148 --> 12:30.517
OF THE CHUM BUCKET MEGA BUCKET.
密谋桶巨型桶。

12:30.550 --> 12:32.853
DO YOU HEAR
SOMETHING?
你听到了吗
有什么东西？

12:32.886 --> 12:34.855
( garbled loudspeaker )
（乱码扬声器）

12:37.858 --> 12:39.927
OKAY, HAVE IT YOUR WAY!
好吧，随你的便吧！

12:39.960 --> 12:41.829
I DON'T MIND BULLDOZING
我不介意推土机

12:41.862 --> 12:43.530
OVER EACH
AND EVERY ONE...
超过每个
还有每个人...

12:43.563 --> 12:45.065
MOMMY, LOOK.
妈妈，看。

12:45.098 --> 12:47.167
SOMEBODY LEFT
THIS TOY TRACTOR HERE.
有人离开了
这台玩具拖拉机在这里。

12:47.200 --> 12:48.168
PUT THAT DOWN,
BILLY.
把它放下，
比利。

12:48.201 --> 12:49.202
THAT HAS GERMS
ON IT.
有细菌的
就它而言。

12:49.236 --> 12:50.237
OH...
哦...

12:50.871 --> 12:52.439
AW, MOM...
哇，妈妈……

12:53.907 --> 12:55.542
YOU'LL SEE!
你会看到的！

12:55.575 --> 12:58.078
YOU'LL ALL SEE!
你们都会看到的！

12:58.111 --> 13:01.348
THE FUTURE SITE
OF THE CHUM BUCKET MEGA BUCKET
未来的网站
密谋桶 巨型桶

13:01.381 --> 13:02.850
MUST BE CLEARED
必须清除

13:02.883 --> 13:05.185
OF THESE CRETINOUS BEACHGOERS
这些白痴海滩游客

13:05.218 --> 13:09.056
BUT IT'S BECOMING
INCREASINGLY OBVIOUS!
但它正在成为
越来越明显！

13:09.089 --> 13:11.591
I CAN DENY IT NO LONGER!
我不能再否认了！

13:11.624 --> 13:14.361
I AM SMALL.
我很小。

13:14.394 --> 13:16.363
I NEED SOMEONE BIG
我需要一个大人物

13:16.396 --> 13:19.299
TO CLEAR THE BEACH FOR ME.
为我清理海滩。

13:19.332 --> 13:20.467
I NEED...
我需要...

13:22.002 --> 13:24.004
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

13:24.037 --> 13:25.973
* STEPPIN' ON THE BEACH,
ROO-TO TO-TOO *
* 踏上海滩，
罗托托托*

13:26.006 --> 13:27.975
* STEPPIN' ON THE BEACH,
ROO-TO TO-TOO *
* 踏上海滩，
罗托托托*

13:28.008 --> 13:29.977
* STEPPIN' ON THE BEACH,
ROO-TO TO-TOO *
* 踏上海滩，
罗托托托*

13:30.010 --> 13:31.945
* STEPPIN' ON THE BEACH,
ROO-TO TO-TOO *
* 踏上海滩，
罗托托托*

13:31.979 --> 13:35.315
YES. HE'S THE ONE.
是的。他就是那个。

13:35.348 --> 13:37.284
( evil laughter )
（邪恶的笑声）

13:38.418 --> 13:39.920
I'LL HAVE ONE...
我要一个...

13:39.953 --> 13:41.121
TWO PLEASE.
请两个。

13:41.154 --> 13:42.923
THANKS.
谢谢。

13:42.956 --> 13:44.291
ONE, PLEASE.
一，请。

13:45.292 --> 13:46.426
EXCUSE ME.
打扰一下。

13:49.963 --> 13:51.131
ONE, PLEASE.
一，请。

13:51.164 --> 13:53.466
SORRY, KID,
WE'RE ALL OUT.
对不起，孩子，
我们都出去了。

13:53.500 --> 13:55.468
AW, BARNACLES.
哇，藤壶。

13:55.502 --> 13:57.337
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

13:57.370 --> 13:59.606
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

13:59.639 --> 14:02.475
PLANKTON, WHAT ARE
YOU DOING HERE?
浮游生物是什么
你在这里做什么？

14:02.509 --> 14:04.444
AND WHY ARE YOU CRYING?
你为什么哭？

14:04.477 --> 14:06.246
OH, HI, SPONGEBOB.
哦，嗨，海绵宝宝。

14:08.248 --> 14:14.521
I'M CRYING BECAUSE I'VE
GOT THESE TWO ICE CREAM CONES
I'M CRYING BECAUSE I'VE
得到了这两个蛋卷冰淇淋

14:14.554 --> 14:16.890
BUT I ONLY NEED ONE.
但我只需要一个。

14:16.924 --> 14:17.857
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

14:17.891 --> 14:21.028
I DON'T KNOW WHAT TO DO
WITH THE OTHER ONE.
我不知道该怎么办
与另一个。

14:21.061 --> 14:23.563
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

14:28.401 --> 14:31.204
I'LL EAT ONE OF THOSE
ICE CREAM CONES FOR YOU.
我要吃其中一个
为您准备的蛋卷冰淇淋。

14:31.238 --> 14:35.142
SPONGEBOB,
WOULD YOU DO THAT FOR ME?
海绵宝宝，
你愿意为我做那件事吗？

14:35.175 --> 14:36.409
SURE.
当然。

14:39.346 --> 14:40.880
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

14:42.715 --> 14:43.650
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

14:48.355 --> 14:49.489
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

14:49.522 --> 14:50.223
YEAH?
是的？

14:50.257 --> 14:51.324
ISN'T IT GREAT
这不是很棒吗

14:51.358 --> 14:54.194
TO GET THE THINGS YOU DESIRE?
为了得到你想要的东西？

14:54.227 --> 14:58.198
LIKE THAT ICE CREAM CONE,
FOR INSTANCE.
就像那个蛋卷冰淇淋，
例如。

14:58.231 --> 15:02.135
YOU CAN HAVE ANYTHING YOU WANT
WITH A LITTLE TRAINING.
你可以拥有任何你想要的
只需一点训练。

15:02.169 --> 15:03.670
TRAINING?
训练？

15:03.703 --> 15:06.139
YES. YOU JUST HAVE TO LEARN
是的。你只需要学习

15:06.173 --> 15:09.509
TO BE MORE ASSERTIVE,
AND I CAN SHOW YOU HOW.
为了更加自信，
我可以告诉你如何做。

15:11.979 --> 15:12.980
ASSERTIVE, HUH?
有主见，是吧？

15:13.013 --> 15:14.381
THAT'S RIGHT.
这是正确的。

15:16.449 --> 15:17.584
ANYTHING I WANT?
我想要什么吗？

15:21.588 --> 15:23.523
SOUNDS GREAT!
听起来很棒！

15:23.556 --> 15:24.958
WONDERFUL.
精彩的。

15:24.992 --> 15:30.230
( evil laughter )
（邪恶的笑声）

15:38.771 --> 15:40.373
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

15:40.407 --> 15:43.276
DON'T LET THAT GUY SIT ON YOU.
不要让那个人坐在你身上。

15:43.310 --> 15:46.179
ASSERTIVENESS LESSON NUMBER ONE.
自信的第一课。

15:46.213 --> 15:48.048
TELL HIM TO GET OFF.
告诉他下车。

15:48.081 --> 15:49.983
UM... EXCUSE ME, SIR.
嗯……对不起，先生。

15:50.017 --> 15:52.119
Y-YOU'RE SITTING
ON MY BODY
你-你坐着
在我身上

15:52.152 --> 15:53.753
WHICH IS ALSO MY FACE.
这也是我的脸。

15:53.786 --> 15:56.056
NO, NO, BE ASSERTIVE.
不，不，要有主见。

15:56.089 --> 15:57.390
BEEP-BEEP.
嘟嘟嘟。

15:58.558 --> 16:00.527
NOT INSERTIVE.
不积极。

16:02.795 --> 16:05.298
SPONGEBOB, YOU
MISSED YOUR CHANCE.
海绵宝宝，你
错过了机会。

16:05.332 --> 16:09.069
YOU'VE GOT TO BE AGGRESSIVE
TO GET THE THINGS YOU WANT.
你必须积极进取
得到你想要的东西。

16:09.102 --> 16:10.003
YOU'RE TOO SOFT.
你太软弱了。

16:10.037 --> 16:11.204
BUT I'M A SPONG...
但我是一块海绵...

16:11.238 --> 16:12.372
DON'T SAY IT.
别说出来。

16:12.405 --> 16:13.206
( slurping )
（吸食）

16:14.707 --> 16:17.477
THERE'S THE GUY WHO
TOOK YOUR ICE CREAM.
那个人是谁
拿走了你的冰淇淋。

16:17.510 --> 16:19.146
DON'T YOU WANT IT BACK?
您不想拿回来吗？

16:19.179 --> 16:20.347
ICE CREAM.
冰淇淋。

16:20.380 --> 16:21.548
LISTEN, YOU.
听着，你。

16:21.581 --> 16:24.517
MY FRIEND'S GOT
SOMETHING TO SAY.
我朋友有
有话要说。

16:24.551 --> 16:26.153
WHAT? WHO SAID THAT?
什么？谁说的？

16:26.186 --> 16:27.520
WAS IT YOU?
是你吗？

16:27.554 --> 16:29.522
TELL HIM OFF, SPONGEBOB.
告诉他别这样，海绵宝宝。

16:29.556 --> 16:31.058
ASSERT YOURSELF.
坚持自己。

16:31.091 --> 16:32.725
THAT'S MY ICE CREAM CONE.
这是我的蛋卷冰淇淋。

16:32.759 --> 16:34.161
GREAT!
伟大的！

16:34.194 --> 16:35.328
NOW LET HIM HAVE IT!
现在就让他拥有吧！

16:35.362 --> 16:37.164
YOU CAN HAVE IT.
你可以拥有它。

16:37.197 --> 16:38.531
SAY, THANKS.
说，谢谢。

16:38.565 --> 16:40.267
NO!
不！

16:40.300 --> 16:42.769
I'LL SHOW YOU HOW.
我会告诉你如何做。

16:42.802 --> 16:44.504
Hey, pencil-neck!
嘿，铅笔颈！

16:45.438 --> 16:46.639
Yeah, you!
是的，你！

16:46.673 --> 16:48.375
Slither over here!
溜过来！

16:48.408 --> 16:51.244
Surrender that ice cream cone
放弃那个蛋卷冰淇淋

16:51.278 --> 16:54.581
or every waking moment
for you will become
或每一个醒着的时刻
因为你会成为

16:54.614 --> 16:58.118
a swirling torrent
of pain and misery!
旋转的激流
痛苦和不幸！

16:59.152 --> 17:00.753
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

17:00.787 --> 17:03.656
HEY, THAT GUY WAS CRYING.
嘿，那个家伙在哭。

17:03.690 --> 17:05.558
THOSE WERE
TEARS OF JOY.
那些是
喜悦的泪水。

17:05.592 --> 17:08.495
HE WAS HAPPY
THAT YOU WERE ASSERTIVE.
他很高兴
你很自信。

17:08.528 --> 17:10.330
YEAH!
是的！

17:10.363 --> 17:13.066
YOU SEE HOW WONDERFUL
LIFE CAN BE
你看多么美妙
生活可以是

17:13.100 --> 17:14.534
WHEN YOU'RE MANIACAL?
当你疯狂的时候？

17:14.567 --> 17:16.803
UH, I THOUGHT
IT WAS CALLED ASSERTIVE.
呃，我以为
这被称为自信。

17:16.836 --> 17:18.171
WHATEVER.
任何。

17:18.205 --> 17:20.373
WELL, IF IT GOT ME
THIS ICE CREAM
好吧，如果它抓住了我
这个冰淇淋

17:20.407 --> 17:21.608
THEN I LIKE IT.
然后我喜欢它。

17:24.577 --> 17:25.745
( beeping )
（嘟嘟声）

17:25.778 --> 17:27.347
I FOUND SOMETHING.
我发现了一些东西。

17:27.380 --> 17:30.750
UH, EXCUSE ME, MY
METAL DETECTOR BROKE.
呃，对不起，我的
金属探测器坏了。

17:30.783 --> 17:32.219
CAN I USE YOURS?
我可以用你的吗？

17:32.252 --> 17:33.553
SURE.
当然。

17:33.586 --> 17:35.088
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

17:35.122 --> 17:36.423
THIS IS YOUR
NEXT LESSON.
这是你的
下一课。

17:36.456 --> 17:37.757
BE AGGRESSIVE.
积极进取。

17:37.790 --> 17:39.626
TELL THAT GUY TO TAKE A HIKE.
告诉那个人去徒步旅行。

17:39.659 --> 17:41.828
DO YOU WANT TO TAKE
A HIKE WITH ME?
你想带吗
和我一起徒步旅行吗？

17:41.861 --> 17:43.163
YEAH.
是的。

17:44.164 --> 17:45.698
NOW LOOK WHAT
YOU'VE DONE!
现在看看什么
你已经完成了！

17:45.732 --> 17:47.800
TELL THAT GUY TO GO
FALL IN A DITCH.
叫那家伙走
掉进沟里。

17:49.169 --> 17:50.770
HEY, GO CHECK
IN THAT DITCH.
嘿，去检查一下
在那条沟里。

17:52.172 --> 17:54.174
WOW. BURIED TREASURE.
哇。埋藏的宝藏。

17:54.207 --> 17:55.508
THANKS.
谢谢。

17:55.542 --> 17:57.277
DID YOU SEE THAT, PLANKTON?
你看到了吗，浮游生物？

17:57.310 --> 17:59.146
THAT GUY FOUND
SOME BURIED TREASURE.
那家伙找到了
一些埋藏的宝藏。

17:59.179 --> 18:01.481
SPONGEBOB, YOU'LL
NEVER GET IT RIGHT.
海绵宝宝，你会的
永远不会做对。

18:01.514 --> 18:04.617
TELL THAT GUY YOU KNOW KARATE
AND YOU'LL TIE HIM IN A KNOT
告诉那个人你懂空手道
你会把他绑在一个结上

18:04.651 --> 18:07.220
IF YOU DON'T GET
YOUR METAL DETECTOR BACK.
如果你没有得到
您的金属探测器回来了。

18:07.254 --> 18:10.123
HEY! I'M GOING TO
TIE YOUR... SHOE
嘿！我要去
系好你的鞋带

18:10.157 --> 18:12.659
IF YOU DON'T
GIVE THAT BACK!
如果你不这样做
把它还给我！

18:12.692 --> 18:14.861
BUT I'M WEARING
SANDALS!
但我穿着
凉鞋！

18:14.894 --> 18:16.363
OKAY! NEVER MIND!
好的！没关系！

18:16.396 --> 18:19.199
IT'S ALL RIGHT, PLANKTON.
HE'S WEARING SANDALS.
没关系，浮游生物。
他穿着凉鞋。

18:19.232 --> 18:20.300
WHAT'S THE MATTER?
怎么了？

18:21.534 --> 18:23.470
OH, NOTHING, SPONGEBOB.
哦，没什么，海绵宝宝。

18:23.503 --> 18:24.471
Mama!
妈妈！

18:24.504 --> 18:26.139
I WAS JUST BEGINNING TO THINK
我刚刚开始思考

18:26.173 --> 18:27.507
THAT THIS IS A WASTE OF TIME.
这是浪费时间。

18:27.540 --> 18:28.541
NO, IT'S NOT.
不，不是。

18:28.575 --> 18:30.310
FORGET IT.
忘了它。

18:30.343 --> 18:33.913
I GUESS YOU DON'T HAVE WHAT IT
TAKES TO BE A STANDUP GUY.
我猜你没有什么
需要成为一个单口相声。

18:33.946 --> 18:36.149
WELL, WHAT
ABOUT AIRLINE FOOD?
嗯，什么
关于航空食品？

18:36.183 --> 18:37.184
WHAT?
什么？

18:37.217 --> 18:38.451
AIRLINE FOOD!
航空食品！

18:38.485 --> 18:40.353
MY GOSH, WHAT IS UP
WITH THAT STUFF?
天哪，怎么了
那些东西？

18:40.387 --> 18:41.554
THANK YOU. GOOD NIGHT.
谢谢。晚安。

18:41.588 --> 18:42.889
( rimshot )
（边缘射击）

18:42.922 --> 18:44.657
SEE, I CAN BE
A STANDUP GUY. SEE?
看，我可以
一个站立的人。看？

18:44.691 --> 18:47.760
SPONGEBOB, YOU'LL NEVER
GET WHAT YOU WANT.
海绵宝宝，你永远不会
得到你想要的。

18:47.794 --> 18:50.730
YOU ALWAYS LET PEOPLE
STEP ALL OVER YOU.
你总是让人们
踩在你身上。

18:50.763 --> 18:52.565
YOU'RE JUST LIKE STAIRS.
你就像楼梯。

18:52.599 --> 18:55.235
WAIT, PLANKTON,
GIVE ME ANOTHER CHANCE.
等等，浮游生物，
再给我一次机会。

18:55.268 --> 18:57.637
OKAY, BUT THIS IS
YOUR LAST CHANCE.
好吧，但这是
你最后的机会。

18:57.670 --> 18:59.572
LOOK AT ALL
THOSE BEACH HOGS
看看所有
那些海滩霸王

18:59.606 --> 19:02.309
SOAKING UP
YOUR SUN RAYS.
吸收
你的阳光。

19:02.342 --> 19:05.245
DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT
TAKES TO GET A TAN?
你有什么吗
需要晒黑吗？

19:05.278 --> 19:06.579
JUST WATCH ME!
看着我！

19:07.680 --> 19:12.452
( all coughing )
（都咳嗽）

19:12.485 --> 19:16.689
MAN, THIS THING IS SAN... DY!
伙计，这东西太糟糕了……哎呀！

19:22.362 --> 19:26.533
YES, MY PLAN
IS BEGINNING TO WORK.
是的，我的计划
正在开始工作。

19:26.566 --> 19:29.202
THEY'RE LEAVING THE BEACH.
他们要离开海滩了。

19:29.236 --> 19:31.538
SPONGEBOB, THAT
WAS WONDERFUL.
海绵宝宝，那个
太棒了。

19:31.571 --> 19:33.673
IS THAT AN ALL-OVER TAN?
这是全身晒黑吗？

19:33.706 --> 19:34.941
WELL, NOT ALL OF ME.
好吧，不是我的全部。

19:34.974 --> 19:36.443
HOT DOGS!
热狗！

19:36.476 --> 19:38.278
HOT DOGS!
热狗！

19:38.311 --> 19:39.879
LOOK AT THAT
HUGE LINE
看看那个
巨大的生产线

19:39.912 --> 19:41.448
AT THE HOT
DOG STAND.
炙手可热
狗架。

19:41.481 --> 19:43.616
ASSERT YOURSELF
TO THE FRONT.
坚持自己
到前面。

19:43.650 --> 19:45.918
I'LL DO BETTER
THAN THAT.
我会做得更好
比那个。

19:50.022 --> 19:52.659
LET'S GO HOME.
我们回家吧。

19:52.692 --> 19:55.228
SPONGEBOB, THAT
WAS GENIUS.
海绵宝宝，那个
是天才。

19:55.262 --> 19:57.597
LOOK AT ALL
THOSE KITE-FLYERS
看看所有
那些放风筝的人

19:57.630 --> 19:58.898
BLOCKING YOUR VIEW.
挡住你的视线。

19:58.931 --> 19:59.899
WHAT?!
什么？！

19:59.932 --> 20:01.401
BREAKING
YOUR WIND.
破坏
你的风。

20:06.406 --> 20:09.409
A-HA-HA-HA-HA-HA-HA!
啊哈哈哈哈！

20:09.442 --> 20:10.910
( growling )
（咆哮）

20:10.943 --> 20:13.513
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
THROW US THE BALL.
嘿，海绵宝宝，
把球扔给我们。

20:19.286 --> 20:21.554
( trumpeting )
（吹号）

20:21.588 --> 20:23.256
WHAT DO WE
DO NOW?
我们做什么
现在就做吗？

20:23.290 --> 20:25.858
LET'S JUST GO HOME,
I GUESS.
我们回家吧，
我猜。

20:27.594 --> 20:30.263
HA! PLANKTON, DID YOU SEE THAT?
哈！浮游生物，你看到了吗？

20:30.297 --> 20:32.399
I WAS A REGULAR ALPHA MALE.
我是一个普通的阿尔法男性。

20:32.432 --> 20:34.567
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

20:34.601 --> 20:35.668
PLANKTON?
浮游生物？

20:35.702 --> 20:36.969
( engine starting )
（发动机启动）

20:37.003 --> 20:38.538
HUH?
嗯？

20:41.641 --> 20:44.944
PLANKTON, ALL MY ASSERTING
HAS DRIVEN EVERYBODY AWAY.
浮游生物，我的全部主张
已经把所有人都赶走了。

20:44.977 --> 20:46.446
EXACTLY.
确切地。

20:46.479 --> 20:48.481
YOU DIDN'T TELL ME
EVERYONE WOULD LEAVE.
你没告诉我
每个人都会离开。

20:48.515 --> 20:49.849
OOPS.
哎呀。

20:52.018 --> 20:53.520
MEGA BUCKET!
巨型桶！

20:53.553 --> 20:57.657
YOU USED ME
FOR LAND DEVELOPMENT.
你利用了我
用于土地开发。

20:57.690 --> 20:59.992
THAT WASN'T NICE.
这不太好。

21:00.026 --> 21:03.530
HAVEN'T YOU FIGURED
IT OUT, SPONGEBOB?
你还没想到吗
海绵宝宝，出来了吗？

21:03.563 --> 21:05.398
NICE GUYS FINISH LAST.
好人最后完成。

21:05.432 --> 21:08.735
ONLY AGGRESSIVE PEOPLE
CONQUER THE WORLD.
只有好斗的人
征服世界。

21:08.768 --> 21:09.969
( evil laughter )
（邪恶的笑声）

21:10.002 --> 21:11.438
WELL...
出色地...

21:11.471 --> 21:15.508
WHAT ABOUT AGGRESSIVELY
NICE PEOPLE?
积极进取又如何
好人？

21:15.542 --> 21:16.443
HUH?
嗯？

21:19.078 --> 21:20.613
WHAT ARE
YOU DOING?
你在干什么？

21:23.683 --> 21:26.686
HOT DOGS! YAY!
热狗！耶！

21:26.719 --> 21:30.723
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

21:30.757 --> 21:31.724
( cheering )
（欢呼）

21:31.758 --> 21:34.894
WAIT. SPONGEBOB, STOP!
等待。海绵宝宝，停下来！

21:43.803 --> 21:45.738
BUTTERFLY KISSES.
蝴蝶之吻。

21:45.772 --> 21:47.940
I... CAN'T TAKE IT.
我……受不了。

21:47.974 --> 21:49.576
IT'S TOO CUTE.
太可爱了。

21:49.609 --> 21:51.978
IT'S, IT'S DISGUSTING!
这，太恶心了！

21:54.447 --> 21:55.915
WHAT HAPPENED?
发生了什么？

21:55.948 --> 21:59.886
I HIT A REEF
WITH MY NEW BOARD, DUDE.
我撞到了礁石
与我的新董事会，伙计。

21:59.919 --> 22:01.087
NO PROBLEM.
没问题。

22:01.120 --> 22:03.423
WHOA!
哇啊！

22:03.456 --> 22:04.957
COLOR!
颜色！

22:04.991 --> 22:08.628
SPONGEBOB, STOP--
BEFORE IT'S TOO LATE.
海绵宝宝，停下——
在为时已晚之前。

22:08.661 --> 22:11.964
YOUR KINDNESS
IS BRINGING EVERYBODY BACK.
你的善意
正在把所有人带回来。

22:14.033 --> 22:14.867
GET BACK!
回来吧！

22:14.901 --> 22:16.703
WAIT!
等待！

22:16.736 --> 22:19.506
OOH! OUCH! OW! OW!
哦！哎哟！噢！噢！

22:19.539 --> 22:22.375
NO! OOH! OW!
不！哦！噢！

22:22.409 --> 22:25.745
COWABUNGA!
科瓦邦加！

22:29.416 --> 22:30.617
THANKS, DUDE.
谢谢，伙计。

22:30.650 --> 22:33.520
THAT WAS AWESOME.
太棒了。

22:33.553 --> 22:34.721
( groaning )
（呻吟）

22:34.754 --> 22:35.855
( groaning )
（呻吟）

22:35.888 --> 22:36.989
GEE, PLANKTON.
哎呀，浮游生物。

22:37.023 --> 22:38.725
I'M SORRY ABOUT
THE CHUM BUCKET.
我很抱歉
密友桶。

22:38.758 --> 22:40.660
FORGET ABOUT THAT.
忘掉这一点吧。

22:40.693 --> 22:46.132
I JUST CAN'T TAKE SO MUCH
KINDNESS AT ONE SITTING.
我实在受不了那么多
善意一席之地。

22:46.165 --> 22:48.935
NEED... HATRED.
需要……仇恨。

22:50.570 --> 22:51.804
VOLLEYBALL, ANYONE?
排球，有人吗？

22:51.838 --> 22:53.072
All:
YEAH!
全部：
是啊！

22:53.105 --> 22:55.408
SERVICE!
服务！

22:55.442 --> 22:56.409
( laughing )
（笑）

22:56.443 --> 22:57.544
OUCH.
哎哟。

22:57.577 --> 22:58.478
( laughing )
（笑）

22:58.511 --> 22:59.679
OUCH.
哎哟。

22:59.712 --> 23:00.847
( laughing )
（笑）

23:03.850 --> 23:05.918
* OOH! WHO LIVES
IN A PINEAPPLE UNDER THE SEA *
*哦！谁活着
在海底的菠萝里 *

23:05.952 --> 23:07.720
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

23:07.754 --> 23:09.556
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

23:09.589 --> 23:11.624
* SPONGEBOB
SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝
方裤！ *

23:11.658 --> 23:13.993
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
IS SOMETHING YOU WISH *
*如果航海废话
这是你想要的 *

23:14.026 --> 23:15.495
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

23:15.528 --> 23:17.764
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑腾*

23:17.797 --> 23:20.099
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

23:20.132 --> 23:27.574
( country-style
acoustic interlude )
（乡村风格
声学插曲）

23:27.607 --> 23:28.908
READY?
准备好？

23:28.941 --> 23:30.910
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

23:30.943 --> 23:32.912
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

23:32.945 --> 23:34.781
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

23:34.814 --> 23:37.116
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

23:37.149 --> 23:38.818
( hearty laughter )
（爽朗的笑声）

